# Build context for both web images (the dev shell at web/Dockerfile,
# the product app's at apps/app/Dockerfile) is the web/ workspace. Exclude
# installed/built artifacts so the container does a clean `pnpm install` from
# the lockfile (no host node_modules leaking in) and the context stays small.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
.DS_Store
.idea

# Secrets, mirroring .gitignore's env paths: the product app's image
# runs `COPY . .` then `next build`, which would bake a developer's
# .env.local into a layer. CI checkouts carry none; a local build must
# not either.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
